{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52548","headline":"圣作物覩 · 陈元光","name":"圣作物覩","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"乾坤正气锺圣物，聪明天纵临生民。\n四灵百端皆符身，九夷八蛮咸来宾。\n制作百爲开彝伦，明禋千载秋又春。\n物覩之圣爲何人，[羲]（义）农尧舜禹汤文。\n万古帝王咸准则，祗令万物覩者德。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陈元光","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52548.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52548","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}